    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a charming four-bedroom detached bungalow, ideally situated along the peaceful and picturesque Cribbons Lane, Rathangan.\n\nSet on a mature and beautifully landscaped site, this attractive country home offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, together with wonderful front and rear gardens that provide a private and tranquil setting.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway, kitchen/dining room, utility room, living room, guest WC, four bedrooms and a family bathroom. The property offers excellent potential for a new owner to create a comfortable and contemporary family home.\n\nA particular feature of the property is its beautifully established gardens. The mature front garden provides an attractive approach to the residence, while the private rear garden is thoughtfully landscaped and offers an ideal outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying the surrounding countryside.\n\nThe property presents an exciting opportunity for those seeking a detached home in a peaceful rural setting, while still benefiting from the convenience of being within easy reach of Rathangan and its local amenities.\n\nWith its generous accommodation, mature gardens and considerable potential, this property is sure to appeal to families, those looking to downsize, or buyers seeking a country home with scope to add their own style and modern touches.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the setting, gardens and potential this lovely country residence has to offer.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, alarm point\n\nKitchen/Dining: Wooden flooring, recessed spot lights, fully fitted kitchen, stainless steel sink, dishwasher, double oven, hob, extractor fan, fridge freezer, double doors leading to sunroom\n\nUtility Room: Tiled flooring, back door leading to rear garden\n\nSunroom: Wooden flooring, recessed spot lights, double doors leading to rear garden\n\nLiving Room: Carpet flooring, recessed spot lights, feature bay window, feature fireplace\n\nGuest WC: Tiled flooring, WHB, WC\n\nBedroom 1: Wooden flooring\n\nEnsuite: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, shower unit, WHB, WC, shaving light and socket\n\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 3: Wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 4: Wooden flooring\n\nFamily Bathroom: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, WHB, WC, bath, separate shower unit, shaving light and socket\n\nFeatures:\n\nFully alarmed\nHardwood front door\nCarpets, curtains, blinds and light fittings included\nAttic access via Stira folding attic stairs\nPVC double glazed windows\nOutside tap\nLocated in a quiet cul-de-sac\nNot overlooked\nGarage with water supply\nGravel driveway\nMains water\nPrivate septic tank\nOil fired central heating\nBuilt in 1998\nc.147.93sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies."
      },
